Package: preENM
Type: Package
Title: Data Preparation and Model Selection for Ecological Niche and Species
    Distribution Models
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kamil", "Konowalik", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "kamil.konowalik@gmail.com")
Description: Tools for the steps around fitting ecological niche models /
    species distribution models (ENM/SDM) with any software. Currently
    implements model evaluation and selection: the simultaneous use of the
    area under the ROC curve (AUC) and the mean absolute error (MAE) proposed
    in Konowalik and Nosol (2021) <doi:10.1038/s41598-020-80062-1>, the true
    skill statistic and the continuous Boyce index; spatial block
    cross-validation across folds and background sets; temporal validation of
    hindcasts against dated (e.g. fossil) records matched to the climate of
    their time; and model selection by conventional minimum values or Pareto
    optimality on user-chosen metrics, with bootstrap estimates of selection
    robustness.
